{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t海關由上月23日起，一連三星期採取代號特別行動，打擊跨境轉運及供應本地冒牌及侵權貨品，檢獲約12萬件懷疑冒牌及侵權貨物，包括波鞋、電話、電話配件、衣服及手錶等，估計市值共約6800萬元。行動中兩人被捕。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：譚佩貞\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T04:09:28.991744+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":108,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T03:32:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T05:44:16.235738+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T04:03:04.610490+00:00","content_hash":"36195ecac23bbfbda6b6f348eec5b1c26d938faa7c7fdde4e2448452e617b29c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}